{'symbol': 'SIVB', 'date': '2022-03-23 08:00:00', 'title': 'SVB SECURITIES STRENGTHENS TECH INVESTMENT BANKING TEAM WITH THE ADDITION OF GEORGI BALINOV', 'text': "BOSTON, MARCH 23, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0SVB SECURITIES, A LEADING INVESTMENT BANK SERVING THE INNOVATION ECONOMY, ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT GEORGI BALINOV HAS JOINED THE FIRM'S TECH INVESTMENT BANKING TEAM AS A SENIOR MANAGING DIRECTOR. HE WILL BE RESPONSIBLE FOR SVB SECURITIES' EFFORTS TO DELIVER ADVISORY AND CAPITAL SOLUTIONS ACROSS THE RAPIDLY GROWING FINTECH VERTICAL."}